Daśaratha resolves tomorrow Puṣya consecration --- Daśaratha recalls Rāma secretly --- Rāma hurries to father --- Daśaratha pleads old age and subjects wish --- Daśaratha cites dreadful dreams and omens --- Daśaratha orders fasting with Sītā during Bharata absence --- Rāma finds Kausalyā praying --- Rāma announces crowning and seeks rites --- Kausalyā blesses Rāma --- Rāma invites Lakṣmaṇa to share rule
